docs {
  ## Create Rate

  Assigns or updates a rate card in the rating engine.

  ### Fields
  - `resource_type` (required): Resource type (e.g. `compute_instance`, `cluster`, `model`, `bare_metal`).
  - `instance_type` (optional): Machine instance type (e.g. `standard-4-16` or empty for any).
  - `catalog_item` (optional): OSAC catalog item name/SKU (e.g. `sim-catalog-standard` or empty for any).
  - `meter_name` (required): Meter name (e.g. `vm_uptime_seconds`, `maas_tokens_in`).
  - `cost_type`: `Infrastructure` or `Supplementary`.
  - `price_per_unit`: Rate per SI unit ($/3600 for seconds, $/1M for tokens).
  - `tiers`: Optional array of graduated price bands.
}
